# Machine state, not sync inputs. The durable set beside these — config.json,
# NOTES.md, conventions.md, previews/ — IS committed.
#
# The staged converter lives here rather than at the repo root specifically so
# this file can ignore it: the root .gitignore is a governance-sensitive path
# an agent cannot add entries to, and a nested .gitignore only reaches its own
# directory downward. Build output canNOT live here — the converter refuses
# [OUT_UNSAFE] to rm anything under .design-sync/ — so it goes to
# docs/design/ds-bundle/, ignored by docs/design/.gitignore.
.cache/
learnings/
node_modules
.ds-sync/
